{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852767958815997972","content":"**Rules:  Which cup is the ball under? (make a wisdom check, no modifier)\n\n3 tries per day.\n\nLimit one of each prize per player.**\n\n**If lost (18 or lower on all 3)**\nThe teen looks at you with a small smirk “Bummer.”\n\n**DC 19**\n**1 correct**- Elder’s Necklace - 3 times a day, you can make your voice sound like that of a wise elders’. This only works if you are giving unsolicited advice \nIf won, post: The teen grabs a necklace from behind the counter and hands it to you. “Here.”\n\n**2 correct**- Sending stone. Just the one. Someone (a raving lunatic)  has the other.\nIf won, post: They hand you a single sending stone and say “Not bad.”\n\n**3 correct-** Eyes of the Eagle wood rimmed glasses\nIf won, post: They reach under the counter and pull out a pair of wood-rimmed circular glasses. “Nice.” They say actually seeming a little impressed.","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:37:50.291000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T16:17:05.535000Z","id":"852768568025153556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
